            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "double",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "The probability that the test rejects the null hypothesis when the alternative hypothesis is true. This is in the range [0, 1], where a lower number is a lower probability.",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
          },
          {
            "Text": "Read only",
            "Links": [],
            "Values": []
